    <span class="eyebrow">Wrong turn</span>
    <h1 class="display-l" style="margin:18px auto 16px;">This page seems to have wandered off the map.</h1>
    <p class="body-2">The link you followed doesn&rsquo;t exist &mdash; it may have a typo, or the page has moved. If someone sent you a private proposal link, double-check every character, or just ask them to resend it.</p>
    <div style="margin-top:30px; display:flex; gap:14px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="/index.html" class="btn">Back to the homepage</a>
      <a href="mailto:keith.pence@fora.travel?subject=Broken%20Link" class="btn btn-ghost">Email Keith</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
